 "remarks": "Coastal Living, Beautifully Reimagined. Thoughtfully renovated with a designer's eye, this four-bedroom, two-bath first-floor residence blends timeless character with modern sophistication. Nine-foot ceilings, hardwood floors, custom architectural details, and carefully curated finishes create a bright, inviting atmosphere throughout. A beautifully appointed eat-in kitchen flows seamlessly into the light-filled living area, perfect for everyday comfort and effortless entertaining. Two spa-inspired bathrooms, full-size in-unit laundry, and four individually controlled climate zones offer both style and convenience. Enjoy a private front porch, separate rear entrance, and glimpses of the harbor in a charming coastal neighborhood. An amazing walking location, Just moments from SoNo's vibrant waterfront, acclaimed restaurants, boutiques and marinas, Metro-North, SONO collection mall and I95. Refined design. Modern comfort. Coastal living at its finest.",
